music/*
!music/README.md

# Generated per-project media: keep plans, manuals, edits and post copy; drop frames/clips/videos
projects/*/frames/
projects/*/clips/
projects/*/output/
projects/*/work/
projects/*/work-*/
*.mp4
*.mov
*.webm
